Z||000000||theogre||08-11-2001||01:08 PM||||Several articles in the cave have been updated, consolidated, and/or moved to different menus. If you can't find a documet where you saw it last it was likely moved to ECM & Electrical or consolidated with another article there.<P>Coolant Fill- Updated, beter covers Propylene Glycol product and added links.<BR>ALDL- Consolidated with ECM QA<BR>ECM notes- Consolidated with ECM QA<BR>Brake Service- Updated, All Upgrade info moved to brake upgrades<BR>Brake Upgrade- Updated, Should help people better understand legal issues with GA upgrade.<BR>Wire Service- total rework, simplified considerably<BR>Fans stuff- updated, corrected 87-88 4 cyl fan info.<P>------------------<BR><I><B>Screamin Yellow Zonkers... If it's Screamin and Yellow, I ain't eatin it.</B></I>||||reg||4
Z||000001||rodmcneill||08-11-2001||08:39 PM||||Thank you for all the work you do to keep us informed. I know you don't talk about it much but how is your health? Hopefully everything is going well with you.||||reg||14
Z||000002||theogre||08-11-2001||08:46 PM||||I'm doing better. lab results from last major tests were good. It's a year now and everything still says I'm clean. Sofarsogood.<P>At some point I'll add wiring diagram for 87-88 4 cyl fan controls.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||1
